<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20130" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληχ-άομαι</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβληχησάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.657
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				3.13
			</span></i>:—<i>bleat</i>, of sheep and goats, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβατίων βληχωμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					535
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				387.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληχώμενοι προβατίων αἰγῶν</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τε . . μέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					293
				</span></i>
			; of infants, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δὲ συγκύψανθ᾽ ἅμα βληχᾶται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					570
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of men, c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάταγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Chr.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληχοῖντο</span> (as if from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληχέομαι</span>) is 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληχῷντο</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				16.92
			</span></i>.</div>
